    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d603">

                <pb facs="1065" n="971" xml:id="pg971"/>

                <head>No. 603.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Baron Rosen.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-10-04"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 4,
                        1887</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Secretary of State presents his compliments to the chargé d’affaires <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ad interim</hi> of Russia, and has the honor to request
                    him to cause the inclosed documents to be authenticated under the seal of the
                    Russian legation and then returned to the Department of State.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
